.TH "Docv::Macros::Mdoc" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Macros::Mdoc \- The mdoc(7) semantic macro package, implemented natively on the roff engine.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Macros::Mdoc < Docv::Roff::Package\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The mdoc(7) semantic macro package, implemented natively on the roff
engine.
.SH "INHERITANCE"
Docv::Macros::Mdoc < Docv::Roff::Package < Reference < Object
.SH "INCLUDED MODULES"
\fBDocv::Macros::MdocData\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef call(name : String, line : String) : Nil\fR
Runs macro \fIname\fR; \fIline\fR holds its arguments, interpolated in copy mode.
.TP 4
\fBdef format : Format\fR
The document format the package produces.
.TP 4
\fBdef handles?(name : String) : Bool\fR
True when \fIname\fR is one of the package\(aqs macros.
